; Control code $14: end the message with a new line
;
; Sets D to $60 (print mode 6 of a word token: end the message with a new
; line) and goes to the ending in #R$7348.
;
; Reached with a jump, so the return goes to the caller of the message printer.
; .
; Hardware: prints through #R$8583 (story window).
@label=EndNewLine
c$7340 LD D,$60      ;
 $7342 JR $734B      ;
